    {
      "metric_id": "transform.target_coherence_residual_given_count",
      "name_zh": "指定变换格数下的目标一致性残差",
      "owner": "atomic.symbol-transform",
      "category": "modifier",
      "display_order": 40,
      "kind": "score",
      "unit": "probability_difference",
      "scope_template": "modifier.symbol-transform×component×state",
      "measurement": "coherence_residual(changed_count, unordered_source_pair_class)=event_equal_mean_same_target_pair_rate-sum_target P(target|source_a)P(target|source_b), fields changed_count|source_a+source_b::same_target_residual",
      "sample_unit": "eligible_multi_cell_transform_event×unordered_source_pair_class",
      "condition_on": "一次实际改变至少2格的合格变形事件及事件内真实无序来源符号对类别；每个事件先在对应来源对类别内计算目标相同的格对比例，再在同组事件间等权平均。独立基线使用同一测量结果中候选自身的P(target|source)边际，原版目标同理",
      "normalization": "每个changed_count|source_a+source_b组输出一个same_target_residual，取值范围[-1,1]；无序来源对按source_domain顺序规范化，source_domain中的来源ID不得包含|、+或::；组权重按候选出现前密封的原版合格事件暴露重新归一，不能使用格对数量或候选频率",
      "applicability_rule": "至少一个结构可达变形事件会实际改变2格及以上，目标域至少有2个可达数学身份，且同一事件内能绑定各改变格的来源与目标时必需。局部只有单格、单一目标或残差由规则恒定唯一的组移除；全部组退化时整项按degenerate_reachable_support不适用。",
      "missing_policy": "事件边界、逐格前后身份、实际改变格数、无序来源对类别、目标条件边际、逐事件同目标率、原版组权重或target_assignment_scope任一缺失时阻塞FORMAL；来源ID包含保留分隔符时必须先映射为画像密封的稳定ID，禁止临时转义；禁止用完整目标向量、完整变形后盘面签名或候选格对频率替代。",
      "inapplicability_reason_codes": ["degenerate_reachable_support"],
      "capability_ids": ["modifier.symbol-transform"],
      "profile_match": {
        "mechanic_id": "modifier.symbol-transform",
        "required_attributes": ["source_domain", "target_domain", "selection_rule", "target_assignment_scope", "event_target_assignment_rule"]
      },
      "semantic_variable_id": "transform.target_coherence_residual_given_changed_count_and_source_pair",
      "semantic_group": "transform_outcome",
      "semantic_role": "primary",
      "relationships": {
        "derived_from": [],
        "cross_checks_with": ["transform.target_symbol_given_source_distribution"],
        "marginal_of": [],
        "conditional_on_metric": [
          "transform.changed_cell_count_distribution",
          "transform.target_symbol_given_source_distribution"
        ],
        "overlap_reason_zh": "变换格数只作条件，目标符号边际只用于计算候选自身独立基线；本指标仅评价同一次多格变形内不能由数量和P(target|source)边际推出的额外同目标耦合，不包含位置或回报。"
      },
      "display": {
        "description_zh": "衡量同一次多格Mystery或批量变形中，各格目标符号是否比逐格独立抽取更倾向保持一致。",
        "usage_scene_zh": "用于区分“整批格子共用一次目标抽取”和“每格独立抽取”；两者可能拥有相同单格目标比例，但事件体验完全不同。",
        "target_meaning_zh": "每组目标值统计指定实际变换格数和无序来源符号对类别下，事件内实际同目标率减去按各来源目标边际计算的独立基线；正值表示额外同向，负值表示额外互斥。",
        "display_unit": "百分点差（同事件目标一致性相对独立基线）"
      },
      "score_group": "modifier",
      "score_budget_key": "transform.target_coherence_residual_given_count",
      "scope_aggregation": "weighted_mean",
      "default_weight": 0.5,
      "score_profile": {
        "method": "grouped_mean_absolute_error",
        "group_separator": "::",
        "group_weight_source": "task_contract",
        "normalization_tolerance": 0.000001,
        "anchors": [[0, 100], [0.01, 95], [0.03, 85], [0.06, 70], [0.12, 50], [0.3, 0]]
      }
    },
    {
      "metric_id": "transform.changed_position_pattern_given_count_distribution",
